# Investments in 2016

## Problem Summary
Write a query to calculate the total 2016 investment for policyholders whose 2015 investment value is shared by multiple policyholders and whose location is unique.

## Solution

```sql
SELECT ROUND(SUM(tiv_2016), 2) AS tiv_2016 FROM Insurance
WHERE tiv_2015 IN (
    SELECT tiv_2015
    FROM Insurance
    GROUP BY tiv_2015
    HAVING COUNT(*) > 1
)
AND (lat, lon) IN (
    SELECT lat, lon
    FROM Insurance
    GROUP BY lat, lon
    HAVING COUNT(*) = 1
);
```
